{"seq":2,"at":"2026-10-20","kind":"edited","target":{"type":"article","id":"a0787"},"reason":"Rewritten by the merge to take in the printed cards' questions.","by":"merge art/design","ref":"quiz-archive/runs/tp-ingest/decisions/art__design.json","changes":[{"field":"bodyEn","diff":[["=",208],["-","He"],["+","In"],["=",1],["-","launched his own women's ready-to-wear line in 1981 and in "],["=",2],["+","he "],["=",48],["-","the company in "],["=",6],["-","it"],["+","the"],["=",1],["+","company "],["=",288],["-","1971"],["+","1971,"],["=",1],["-","and whose house had drifted since, "],["=",52],["-","for thirty-six years, "],["=",13],["+"," He was as famous for his tongue as for his collections: the line most often quoted from him in Germany, \"Anyone who wears sweatpants has lost control of their life\", is said to have been delivered on a German talk show in 2012 and has followed jogging bottoms around ever since."],["=",123],["-","in"],["+","and"],["=",1],["-","\"On"],["+","the"],["=",1],["-","Her"],["+","German"],["=",1],["-","Majesty's"],["+","Olympic"],["=",1],["-","Secret"],["+","squad"],["=",1],["-","Service\""],["+","for"],["=",1],["+","decades.\n\nCelebrities have tried their hand too. In 2009 the actor Matthias Schweighöfer, the TV presenter Joko Winterscheidt, the designer Kilian Kerner "],["=",4],["+","entrepreneur Sebastian Radlmeier founded the label "],["=",2],["-","Olympic"],["+","Garment,"],["=",1],["-","squad"],["+","selling"],["=",1],["-","for"],["+","T-shirts"],["=",1],["-","decades."],["+","and casual wear with a deliberately German name. It made headlines rather than history and has since been wound down."],["=",136],["+","\n| German Garment | celebrity label | 2009 |"],["=",5],["-","these"],["+","the"],["=",1],["+","great "],["=",49]]},{"field":"bodyDe","diff":[["=",204],["-","1981 brachte er seine erste eigene Damenkollektion heraus, und "],["=",46],["-","am Unternehmen "],["=",10],["-","es"],["+","das"],["=",1],["+","Unternehmen "],["=",276],["-","war"],["+","war,"],["=",1],["-","und dessen Haus seither dahindümpelte, "],["=",46],["-","sechsunddreißig Jahre lang inne, "],["=",14],["-","2019."],["+","2019 inne. Für seine Zunge war er so berühmt wie für seine Kollektionen: Der in Deutschland meistzitierte Satz von ihm, „Wer Jogginghosen trägt, hat die Kontrolle über sein Leben verloren“, soll 2012 in einer Talkshow gefallen sein und verfolgt die Jogginghose seither."],["=",101],["-","in „Im Geheimdienst Ihrer Majestät“ "],["=",12],["+","Auch Prominente versuchten sich. 2009 gründeten der Schauspieler Matthias Schweighöfer, der Moderator Joko Winterscheidt, der Designer Kilian Kerner und der Unternehmer Sebastian Radlmeier das Label German Garment, das T-Shirts und Freizeitmode mit bewusst deutschem Namen verkaufte. Es machte eher Schlagzeilen als Geschichte und ist inzwischen eingestellt.\n\n"],["=",129],["+","\n| German Garment | Promi-Label | 2009 |"],["=",3],["-","diese"],["+","die"],["=",1],["+","großen "],["=",47]]}]},
